<!-- doc/src/sgml/release-3.5.sgml -->
<!-- See header comment in release.sgml about typical markup -->

<sect1 id=release-3-5-28>
 <title>Release 3.5.28</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2020-11-19</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-10-03 [d4cd86e]
    -->
    <para>
     <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 不支持 <acronym>GSSAPI</acronym>.
	 允许 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 处理 <acronym>GSSAPI</acronym> encrypted connection request from frontend 而不是响应错误. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     补丁由...创建 me, 由...审查和测试 Umar Hayat.
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-11-17 [94cbceb]
    -->
    <para>
	 修复 query rewrite syntax error of "INSERT ... ON CONFLICT" in native replication mode.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=654">bug 654</ulink>) (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-10-30 [0e76626]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 connection counter was not counted down when query is canceled.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=656">bug 656</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-23 [cefb2fc]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 pgpool_setup bugs while checking the version of PostgreSQL. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id=release-3-5-27>
 <title>Release 3.5.27</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2020-09-17</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-13 [d35acfc]
    -->
    <para>
     Follow the guide line of <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 12.4 关于扩展。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <command>CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION</command> 应避免。 改用 <command>CREATE FUNCTION</command> 代替。
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-14 [7bf7f09]
    -->
    <para>
     移除某些代码路径中不必要的检查。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     补丁贡献者 Hou, Zhijie.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-06 [07c8b39]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 relcache query sometimes sent to other than primary. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     In streaming replication mode, relcache queries are supposed to be
     sent to the primary node. But actually they were not sent to the primary
     node if primary node was not the master node. Typically this could
     happen when the primary is not node 0.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-01 [fcb9ac4]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <xref linkend="GUC-CONNECTION-LIFE-TIME"> 当...启用时不工作 <xref linkend="GUC-SERIALIZE-ACCEPT"> 启用时。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
	 讨论： <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2020-August/007233.html">[pgpool-general: 7175]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-30 [53457d9]
    -->
    <para>
     在认证过程中显示更详细的错误信息。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-21 [310650e]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 segfault in pgpool child process in certain case. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
	 This issue can be reproduced with the following steps:
     <orderedlist>
	  <listitem>
	   <para>
        关闭所有后端。
	   </para>
	  </listitem>
	  <listitem>
	   <para>
        使用无效客户端连接到pgpool。 I have used <command>pcp_attach_node</command> 使用pgpool的端口号，而不是pcp的。
	   </para>
	  </listitem>
     </orderedlist>
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id=release-3-5-26> 
 <title>Release 3.5.26</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2020-08-20</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-05-22 [a73d5a1]
    -->
    <para>
     添加关于...的说明 <literal>hostssl/hostnossl</literal> to <filename>pool_hba.conf</filename> 示例文件。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-12 [0462d90]
    -->
    <para>
     At pgpool startup, if pid file exists, truncate pid file to zero length before writing. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     补丁由...创建 maliangzhu.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-11 [81b1e3e]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <xref linkend="guc-connection-life-time"> 当主节点不是0时不工作 在流复制模式下。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-05 [014458a]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <command>pgpool_setup</command> problem with -r option and <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 12. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-31 [ea1a420]
    -->
    <para>
     更改PCP <literal>UNIX_DOMAIN_PATH</literal> RPM包的 <filename>/var/run/postgresql</filename>. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
	2020-08-05 [6b31f2e]
    2020-07-14 [21bdf08]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 query cache bugs. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     如果启用查询缓存, 当表被更新时， Pgpool-II应删除与该表相关的所有缓存。
	 然而， <command>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</command> and <acronym>CTE</acronym> with data-modifying SQLs
	 被错误地当作普通只读查询处理 导致查询缓存未被删除。
    </para>
    <para>
     补丁由...创建 Hou, Zhijie and 由...修改 Tatsuo Ishii.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-07-09 [4827bd4]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 在某些边界情况下挂起。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-06-26 [5f62ef2]
    -->
    <para>
     If there are parameters other than "user", "database" and "application_name", 读取启动包失败。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-06-22 [7587851]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 miscount of connections when <function>pg_terminate_backend()</function> 被执行时。 (Takuma Hoshiai)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-06-04 [4100dbf]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 segmentation fault when application name is included in <xref linkend="GUC-LOG-LINE-PREFIX">. (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=615">bug 615</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

