<sect1 id=release-3-5-22> 
 <title>Release 3.5.22</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2019-08-15</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>增强功能</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-08-08 [94b0ce1]
    -->
    <para>
     Import some of 内存管理器调试设施 from <productname>PostgreSQL</productname>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-07-24 [d3493f7]
    -->
    <para>
     改用 <function>pg_get_expr()</function> 代替 <literal>pg_attrdef.adsrc</literal> to support for <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 12. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-08-11 [c553e51]
    2019-08-08 [94364ad]
    2019-07-17 [5730d28]
    2019-07-02 [b364caa]
    -->
    <para>
     增强...的关闭脚本 <xref linkend="PGPOOL-SETUP">. (Tatsuo Ishii)
      <itemizedlist> 
       <listitem>
	<para>
	 使shutdownall等待...关闭完成 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname>.
	</para>
       </listitem>
       <listitem>
	<para>
	 If environment variable <varname>CHECK_TIME_WAIT</varname> 设置为true时， use <command>netstat</command> 命令确认...的使用 <literal>TCP/IP</literal> port 执行关闭脚本时。
	</para>
       </listitem>
      </itemizedlist> 
    </para>
   </listitem>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-05-22 [57cd1d4]
    -->
    <para>
     处理 <literal>pgpool_adm</literal> extension with <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 12. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-08-09 [c896d21]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 "无法绑定。无法获取解析消息" error.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=531">bug 531</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-08-08 [0da5292]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 复制模式和watchdog下子进程异常退出后在线恢复被阻塞。 
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=483">bug 483</ulink>) (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-07-28 [fbe8fdc]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <xref linkend="PGPOOL-SETUP"> 生成正确的follow master命令。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-07-07 [44f8e2d]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 查询缓存模块以检查oid数组边界。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-07-07 [ae45e93]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 查询缓存模块中的off-by-one错误。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-07-03 [380d8a5]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 segfault when query cache 启用时。 (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=525">bug 525</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-07-02 [b8137d6]
    -->
    <para>
     降低日志级别 "checking zapping sent message ..." 到DEBUG5。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     讨论： <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2019-June/006678.html">[pgpool-general: 6620]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-06-24 [057a635]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 segfault when <literal>samenet</literal> is 在...中指定 <filename>pool_hba.conf</filename>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     讨论： <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2019-June/006659.html">[pgpool-general: 6601]</ulink>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-06-07 [9d7c5ba]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 处理 backslashes according to the config of <varname>standard_conforming_strings</varname> in native replication mode.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=467">bug 467</ulink>) (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-08-14 [0d6fdbc]
    2019-05-23 [0e8c1c2]
    2019-05-22 [c264275]
    2019-05-22 [53e7af0]
    2019-05-22 [19cfda2]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 memory leaks. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-05-23 [827a056]
    -->
    <para>
     Make failover in progress check more aggressively to avoid potential segfault. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id=release-3-5-21> 
 <title>Release 3.5.21</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2019-05-16</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>增强功能</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-05-03 [6a4130f]
    -->
    <para>
     Speed up failover when all of backends are down. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     如果所有后端都处于宕机状态， 立即放弃查找 
     primary node 无论search_primary_node_timeout如何，并及时 
     完成故障转移过程。
    </para>
    <para>
     讨论： <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2019-May/003321.html">[pgpool-hackers: 3321]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-04-30 [0cd3d5f]
    2019-04-30 [06d9887]
    -->
    <para>
     pgpool-recovery extension and <command>pgpool_setup</> is now ready for the next major release <productname>PostgreSQL</> 12. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-05-09 [f9536cc]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 the wrong error message "ERROR: connection cache is full", 当所有后端节点都宕机时。 
     (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=487">bug 487</>) (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     When all backend nodes are down, <productname>Pgpool-II</> 抛出错误信息
     error message "ERROR: connection cache is full". Change the error
     message to "all backend nodes are down, pgpool requires at least one valid node".
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-04-21 [d2bb1ec]
    -->
    <para>
     避免pool_worker_child进程的exit/fork风暴。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     pool_worker_child 使用...发出查询以获取WAL位置 <function>do_query()</>,
     这可能导致FATAL错误。 In this case pool_worker_child process
     exits and <productname>Pgpool-II</> 父进程立即分叉新进程。 This cycle
     indefinitely repeats and gives high load to the system.
     To avoid the exit/fork storm, 暂停 <varname>sr_check_period</>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-04-18 [157c5fe]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <xref linkend="GUC-WRITE-FUNCTION-LIST">'s 损坏的默认值。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-04-17 [d0b0fd0]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 "缓冲区空间不足"错误。 
     (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=499">bug 499</>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     The error occurred while processing error message returned from
     backend and the cause is that the query string in question is too
     big. Problem is, 缓冲区是固定大小(8192字节)。
     Eliminate the fixed size buffer and use palloced buffer
     代替。 这也节省了部分内存拷贝工作。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-04-16 [65f5db4]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 DROP DATABASE failure. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-04-10 [c7d8845]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 中的错误变量 <function>read_status_file()</> function.
     (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=493">bug 493</>) (Takuma Hoshiai)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-04-02 [8e6176c]
    -->
    <para>
     如果故障转移/故障恢复正在进行中，中止会话以防止潜在的段错误。 
     (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=481">bug 481</ulink>, 
     <ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=482">bug 482</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-03-30 [508f1c4]
    2019-03-30 [ab6c527]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 编译器警告。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-03-28 [b39953c]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 扩展查询中"batch"模式的内存泄漏。 
     (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=468">bug 468</>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id=release-3-5-20> 
 <title>Release 3.5.20</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2019-03-29</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>增强功能</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-03-27 [4c6d5c3]
    -->
    <para>
     添加新的配置选项 <xref linkend="guc-ssl-prefer-server-ciphers">. (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
    <para>
     添加新的设置 <xref linkend="guc-ssl-prefer-server-ciphers"> to let users configure if they
      want client's or server's cipher order to take preference.
    </para>
    <para>
     此参数的默认值为off， which prioritize the client's
     cipher order as usual. 然而 this is just for keeping backward
     compatibility, and it is possible that a malicious client uses weak
     ciphers. For this reason we recommend to set this parameter to on at
     all times.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-03-23 [d919f5a]
    -->
    <para>
     允许 to set a client cipher list. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     For this purpose new parameter <xref linkend="guc-ssl-ciphers">, which specifies the cipher
      list to be accepted by <productname>Pgpool-II</>, 被添加。
      This is already implemented in <productname>PostgreSQL</> and useful to enhance security when SSL 启用时。 
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2019-03-18 [d95f1f6]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 unnecessary <function>fsync()</> to <filename>pgpool_status</> file. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     每当创建到PostgreSQL后端的连接时， <function>fsync()</>
     被发起到 <filename>pgpool_status</> file, which could generate excessive I/O
     in certain conditions.
     因此减少发出...的机会 <function>fsync()</> so that it is issued only when
     backend status is changed.
    </para>
    <para>
     讨论： <ulink url="http://www.sraoss.jp/pipermail/pgpool-general/2019-February/006494.html">[pgpool-general: 6436]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

