     修复 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> hang when <varname>idle_in_transaction_session_timeout = on</varname>. (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=448">bug 448</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
