    -->
    
    <para>
     修复 查询缓存失效bug。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
   
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-11-03 [c466e5c]
    -->
    
    <para>
     修复 segfault in 扩展查询+查询缓存情况。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
   
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-11-01 [c47ba42]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 扩展查询+查询缓存启用时的内存泄漏。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id="release-3-5-17">
 <title>Release 3.5.17</title>

 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2018-10-31</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-30 [3d0311b]
    -->
    <para>
     允许 <command>PCP[attach/detach/promote]</command> 故障转移期间的命令。 (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-18 [d3c29b7]
    -->
    <para>
     Change <filename>pgpool.spec</filename> 安装支持LLVM JIT的DB服务器的扩展的文件。 (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-08-29 [ed8bfa5]
    -->
    <para>
     测试： 添加SSL连接的回归测试。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-08-10 [e41a92a]
    -->
    <para>
     测试： Add 中的PGLIB定义 <filename>regress.sh</filename>. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     Patch provided by Jesper Pedersen.
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-25 [c031a7e]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 typo in <varname>child_max_connections</varname> description of <command>SHOW POOL_STATUS</command> output. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     Patch provided by Phil Ramirez.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-22 [f1b13a4]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 segmentation fault when 原生复制模式下发送错误查询和Sync消息。 (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=434">bug 434</ulink>) (Takuma Hoshiai)
    </para>
    <para>
     In native replication mode, 查询错误后立即发送Sync消息时发生段错误。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-18 [22e9242]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 查询包含时间函数和...时的语法错误 <literal>IN (SELECT ...)</literal> in 
     <literal>WHERE</literal> clause in native replication mode. 
     (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=433">bug 433</ulink>) (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     In native replication mode, 包含时间函数的查询 (e.g. <function>now()</function>, <function>CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</function> etc.) 被重写为时间戳常量值。 
     然而， <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 不支持 包含时间函数的查询 and <literal>IN (SELECT ...)</literal> in <literal>WHERE</literal> clause.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-12 [75cff9a]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 使用扩展协议时偶尔返回前端的数据较少。 (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=432">bug432</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     The idea for fix is, 使用待处理消息数据列表。 It records
     messages from frontend, and it is expected that we will receive same
     number of messages.
    </para>
    <para>
     初始补丁由...创建 Yugo Nagata 并由...修复 Tatsuo Ishii.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-11 [be2e21c]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 中的内存泄漏 <function>trigger_failover_command()</function>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-11 [ebbdd6f]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 memory leak 流复制模式+扩展查询情况下启用查询缓存时。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-09 [5072e78]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 memory leak 当memory_cache_enabled=on且发送写SQL时。 (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     在显式事务中， the <literal>SELECT</literal> 结果被缓存在临时缓冲区中。
     If a write <acronym>SQL</acronym> is sent which modifies the table, 临时缓冲区应被重置。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-10-09 [26642f7]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 回归测试中的偶尔失败 065.bug152. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-09-21 [011e56b]
    -->
    <para>
     测试： Add <literal>EXECUTE/DEALLOCATE</literal> regression test. (Takuma Hoshiai)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-09-19 [576f576]
    -->
    <para>
     Add missing <filename>pgpool_recovery--1.0--1.1.sql</filename> file to update 
     <function>pgpool_recovery()</function> function version to 1.1. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-09-13 [f771dd1]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 kind mismatch error when <literal>DEALLOCATE</literal> statement is issued. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     <literal>PREPARE</literal> should be add to pool_add_sent_message, 
     so that <literal>EXECUTE</literal> and <literal>DEALLOCATE</literal>
     可以发送到与...相同的节点 <literal>PREPARE</literal>.
    </para>
    <para>
     See <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2018-September/006284.html">[pgpool-general: 6226]</ulink> for more details.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-08-27 [afb0617]
    -->
    <para>
     Do not update <xref linkend="guc-pool-passwd"> if the password length is incorrect. 
      (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=419">bug 419</ulink>) (Takuma Hoshiai, Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     For <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 3.7 or before, the password stored in 
     <xref linkend="guc-pool-passwd"> is <literal>MD5</literal> password only. 
      So check the correctness of <xref linkend="guc-pool-passwd"> by scanning entire file.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-08-10 [3d4e5f6]
    -->
    <para>
     测试： Update <filename>clean.sh</filename> which clean up regression test results. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     Patch provided by Jesper Pedersen.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-08-10 [5abd56e]
    -->
    <para>
     Add .gitignore files. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     Patch provided by Jesper Pedersen.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-08-05 [d56f618]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 segfault when node 0 is in down status in case of both health check 
     and <xref linkend="guc-failover-on-backend-error"> are disabled. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

