<sect1 id="release-3-5-15">
 <title>Release 3.5.15</title>

 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2018-06-12</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-05-31 [871c089]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 复制延迟过大时挂起， when query cache enabled in extended query mode. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     See <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general-jp/2018-May/001533.html">[pgpool-general-jp: 1534]</ulink> 
     for more details.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-05-24 [c88c336]
    -->
    <para>
     In extended query mode, SET TRANSACTION READ ONLY时不设置写事务标志。 (Tatsuo Ishii) 
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-04-18 [7f47596]
    -->
    <para>
     Prevent <xref linkend="PCP-RECOVERY-NODE"> 恢复"未使用"状态节点 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     这允许尝试恢复没有配置数据的节点，
     这导致各种问题。 
    </para>
    <para>
     See <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2018-March/006021.html">[pgpool-general: 5963]</ulink> 
     for more details.
    </para>
    <para>
     Also I fixed <function>pgpool_recovery</function> function so that it quotes an 
     empty string argument with double quotes. 
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

