<sect1 id="release-3-5-13">
 <title>Release 3.5.13</title>

 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2018-02-13</simpara>
 </note>
 <note>
  <para>
   本次发布修复了在Pgpool-II 3.7.0、3.6.6和3.5.10中添加的套接字写入bug。由于此bug，在网络负载高时，可能会向前端或后端发送非法消息。所有使用3.7.x、3.6.6及更高版本、3.5.10及更高版本Pgpool-II的用户应尽快更新。
  </para>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-02-10 [a61b2bc]
    -->
    <para>
     允许 to build with <literal>libressl</>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     See <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2018-February/002714.html">[pgpool-hackers: 2714]</ulink> for more details. Patch by Sandino Araico Sanchez.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-01-29 [ca57328]
    -->
    <para>
     设置TCP_NODELAY和非阻塞到前端套接字。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     TCP_NODELAY is employed by <productname>PostgreSQL</>, so do we it.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-01-19 [e2be15a]
    -->
    <para>
     Change 使用...的systemd服务文件 <varname>STOP_OPTS=" -m fast"</>. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-01-19 [883e0ae]
    -->
    <para>
     Change <command>pgpool_setup</> 在...中添加restore_command <filename>recovery.conf</>. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-02-09 [4ffa279]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 提交或回滚时意外设置了写事务标志。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-01-29 [cfbde79]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 套接字写入bug。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <function>pool_write_flush()</function> is responsible for writing to sockets when pgpool's
     write buffer is full (this function was introduced in 3.6.6 etc). When
     network write buffer in kernel is full, it does retrying but it forgot
     to update the internal buffer pointer. As a result, broken data is
     written to the socket. This results in variety of problems including
     too large message length.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-01-24 [5afc059]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 segfault when %a is in <varname>log_line_prefix</> and debug message is on. (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=376">bug 376</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>

   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2018-01-18 [59267e3]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 queries hanging in <function>parse_before_bind</> with extended protocol and replication + load-balancing. (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=377">bug 377</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id="release-3-5-12">
 <title>Release 3.5.12</title>

 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2018-01-09</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-12-22 [725e7fb]
    -->
    <para>
     Replace <command>/bin/ed</command> with <command>/bin/sed</command> in <xref linkend="pgpool-setup">, because <command>/bin/sed</command> is included in most distribution's base packages. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-12-21 [20d83ee]
    -->
    <para>
     Change the <filename>pgpool.service</filename> and sysconfig files to output <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> log. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     Removing "Type=forking" and add OPTS=" -n" to
     run <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> with non-daemon mode, because we need to redirect logs.
     Using <command>"journalctl"</command> command to see <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> systemd log.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-12-18 [6aaa2bd]
    2017-12-17 [29c26a7]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 复制模式下的时间戳数据不一致。 (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     From <productname>PostgreSQL</productname>10 the column
     default value such as 'CURRENT_DATE' changes,
     <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> didn't rewrite
     timestamp by the added default values. 这导致数据不一致。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-12-14 [b590851]
    -->
    <para>
     将日志消息降级为调试消息。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     上次开发周期中误留下的。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-12-12 [a94ee75]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 从后端读取数据包的重同步逻辑。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <function>read_kind_from_backend()</function>, which reads message kind
     from backend, re-syncs backend nodes when a ready for query message is
     received. Unfortunately it forgot to call
     <function>pool_pending_message_pull_out()</function> to delete sync
     pending message. This leads to random stuck while reading packets
     from backend. 修复 this to call <function>pool_pending_message_pull_out()</function>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-12-12 [2124bbd]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 挂起. (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=370">bug 370</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     If an erroneous query is sent to primary and without a sync message
     the next query that requires a catalog cache look up is send,
     <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 挂起 in <function>do_query()</function>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-12-12 [5b2a5dc]
    -->
    <para>
     Add SL_MODE宏以提高与Pgpool-II 3.7或更高版本的兼容性。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-12-10 [719fb06]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 收到"ready for query"消息时返回事务状态。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     We return primary or master node state of ready for query message to
     frontend. 大多数情况下这是好的。 然而 if other than primary
     node or master node returns an error state (this could happen if load
     balance node is other than primary or master node and the query is an
     erroneous SELECT), this should be returned to frontend, because the
     frontend already received an error.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-11-16 [b6c750b]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 pgpool 启动消息被打印多次。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-11-15 [11d506a]
    -->
    <para>
     在...的启动/停止脚本中添加执行权限位 <xref linkend="watchdog-setup">. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id="release-3-5-11">
 <title>Release 3.5.11</title>

 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2017-11-01</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-10-31 [f4e1e93]
    -->
    <para>
     Add RHEL6和RHEL7的不同pgpool.sysconfig文件。 (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=343">bug 343</ulink>) (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     在RHEL6中，需要"-n"选项来重定向日志。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-10-16 [94b9919]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 for watchdog中故障转移不可靠执行的bug。 (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
    <para>
     Currently watchdog process only considers the node's watchdog state before
     deciding if it can handle the failover and failover-locking requests.
    </para>
    <para>
     但此技术的问题是， for the instance when the node has
     announced itself as a master/coordinator of the cluster and is waiting for the
     standby nodes to recognise it as a Master node. For that period of time the
     watchdog state of the node is Master/coordinator, but it is yet not fully
     capable of handling the failover and failover-locking requests.
    </para>
    <para>
     So sometimes this leads to a situation where a failover is not reliably
     performed in case when the failover request arrives while watchdog cluster is
     in the process of electing a leader.
    </para>
    <para>
     上述情况的修复是确保节点在接受故障转移和故障转移锁定请求之前已完全获得Master状态。

    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-10-10 [6cf6ae1]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 bug with handling of 'H' (flush) message 在流复制模式下。 (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=345">bug 345</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     如果用户期望在'H'后立即读取响应， <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 挂起. The
     cause was, when 'H' received, extended query mode was reset and
     pending message was not used.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-10-08 [3c40260]
    -->
    <para>
     文档： 修复 <command>pcp_node_info</command> 文档。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>

    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-09-22 [86d1195]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 故障转移后立即错误覆盖全局后端状态的bug。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     See <ulink url="http://www.sraoss.jp/pipermail/pgpool-general/2017-September/005786.html">[pgpool-general: 5728]</ulink> for more details.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-09-22 [3acd553]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 退出信号处理器不调用ereport。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     See <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2017-September/002545.html">[pgpool-hackers: 2545]</ulink> for more details.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-09-11 [dbfbb10]
    -->
    <para>
     处理 with OpenSSL 1.1. (Tatsuo Ishii, Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id="release-3-5-10">
 <title>Release 3.5.10</title>

 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2017-09-05</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-09-02 [322eb19]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 流复制模式和扩展查询中出现错误时挂起。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     如果后端返回ERROR， <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> reads message from frontend until
     a <literal>sync</literal> message is sent. Previous code assumed next message is <literal>sync</literal>.
     然而 it is possible that more message coming before the <literal>sync</literal>
     message, 虽然概率较低。 修复 it to continue reading
     messages until the <literal>sync</literal> message is read.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-09-01 [ad90886]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <varname>wd_authkey</varname> 请求向集群添加新节点被master拒绝的bug。 (Yugo Nagata)
    </para>
    <para>
     这是3.5.6和3.6.3实现导致的bug。
    </para>
    <para>
     This changed the definition of tv_sec that is used to check wd_authkey so
     that this was affected by the clock of OS. So, if there is a lag between
     two nodes' clocks, the wd_authkey check fails.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-09-01 [56dccb4]
    -->
    <para>
     测试： 修复 负载均衡测试驱动程序。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     一些仅用于原生复制模式的测试也在流复制模式下执行了。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-31 [b380241]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 not working <literal>slony</literal> mode in extended query. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     When response returned from backend, in progress flag was not reset in <literal>slony</literal> mode, 导致徒劳地等待来自后端的下一个消息。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-29 [e0d27bd]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 流写模块的古老bug。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     修复 bug with <function>pool_write_noerror()</function> 当请求长度超过剩余写入缓冲区大小时。 这可能导致缓冲区溢出问题。
    </para>
    <para>
     当写入缓冲区满时， <function>pool_flush_it()</function> 被调用，可能在消息中间将数据写入套接字。 修复方法：如果写入缓冲区即将满则直接写入请求数据。
    </para>
    <para>
     增强...的性能 <function>pool_unread()</function>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-24 [661c8d3]
    -->
    <para>
     测试： 回归测试脚本中的一些杂项小修复。 (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
    <para>

    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-24 [7bcd7b8]
    -->
    <para>
     文档： 修复 关于负载均衡的文档。 (Yugo Nagata)
    </para>
    <para>

    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-16 [2db0ded]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 核心转储和临时表处理不当。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-15 [2f3d3e1]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 ancient bug of <function>pool_unread()</function>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     When <function>realloc()</function> is called in <function>pool_unread()</function>, it did not update the
     buffer size.  This could cause variety of memory corruption and
     unexpected data reading from backend. The reason why we did not found
     that is, probably recently <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> starts extensively to use
     <function>pool_unread()</function>.

    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-13 [645468e]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 空查询的处理。 (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=328">bug 328</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     当发送空查询（空字符串或全注释查询）时， command
     complete message was returned to frontend.  这不正确。 An
     empty query response should be returned to frontend.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-09 [e1de72c]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 流复制模式和扩展查询情况下的查询缓存bug。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-03 [0780efe]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 memory leak 流复制模式/扩展查询情况下。 (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=324">bug 324</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-03 [3b298f0]
    -->
    <para>
     测试： 修复 005回归测试中的Java程序。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-03 [49e47ec]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 for 当故障转移由worker进程触发时，错误的DB节点可能发生故障转移。 (<ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=303">bug 303</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     This is due to the db_node_id member in the <varname>POLL_CONNECTION</varname> structure is not initialized in the process （在子进程中该成员正确初始化）。 To solve the problem, add new function <function>pool_set_db_node_id()</function> to set the structure member variable and call it inside <function>make_persistent_db_connection()</function>.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-07-31 [c4a2a44]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 starting unnecessary transaction when <command>SET</command> command is issued. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-07-27 [6586da8]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 for <ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2017-July/005679.html">[pgpool-general: 5621]</ulink> <function>Failover()</function> function 应以禁用健康检查警报的方式执行。 (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-07-27 [7958f97]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 复制模式中扩展查询错误情况下的挂起bug或其他错误。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     以及此提交中的其他修复。
    </para>
    <para>
     1) Do not send intended error query to backend in streaming replication mode in <function>ErrorResponse3()</function>.
    </para>
    <para>
     2) 修复 <function>pool_virtual_master_db_node_id()</function> 仅在查询进行中且查询上下文存在时返回virtual_master_node_id。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-07-20 [504fb3b]
    -->
    <para>
     允许 make dist to include <filename>pgpool.service</filename>. (Yugo Nagata)
    </para>
    <para>

    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
 <sect2>
  <title>增强功能</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-09 [50223bc]
    -->
    <para>
     测试： Redirect build log to a log file. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-08-09 [ea3a958]
    -->
    <para>
     测试： Add more memory leak regression tests. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

<sect1 id="release-3-5-9">
 <title>Release 3.5.9</title>

 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2017-07-11</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>

  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-07-07 [d845be6]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 for <ulink url="http://www.sraoss.jp/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2017-June/002400.html">[pgpool-hackers: 2400]</ulink> 垃圾输出 (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
    <para>
     主要是日志消息修复和少量代码清理。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-06-29 [e83a274]
    -->
    <para>
     Importing the latest changes in the <productname>MemoryManager API</productname> from <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> code. (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-06-21 [cc0b21d]
    -->
    <para>
     修复ing  <ulink url="http://www.sraoss.jp/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2017-June/002390.html">[pgpool-hackers: 2390]</ulink>守护进程模式下的相对路径问题 (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-06-19 [d1013ac]
    -->
    <para>
     Adjust function name change in <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 10 dev head. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <programlisting>
     pg_current_wal_location     -> pg_current_wal_lsn
     pg_last_wal_replay_location -> pg_last_wal_replay_lsn
    </programlisting>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-06-09 [b86e7b7]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 a 流复制和扩展协议的潜在挂起 (Yugo Nagata)
    </para>
    <para>
     此挂起在特定条件下发生。 The following is an example.
    </para>

    <programlisting>
     - pgpool.conf is 配置为所有读查询发送到备用节点。
     - 首先，在事务块中发出写查询
     - 提交事务后，发出select查询。
     - 处理查询时，在Parse之后立即发送Describe(statement)消息。
    </programlisting>

    <para>
     Without using <productname>JDBC</productname>, we can reproduce the problem by <productname>pgproto</productname> with the following messages.
    </para>

    <programlisting>
     'Q' "DROP TABLE IF EXISTS test_tbl"
     'Y'
     'Q' "CREATE TABLE test_tbl(i int)"
     'Y'
     'Q' "INSERT INTO test_tbl VALUES(1)"
     'Y'

     'P' "" "BEGIN" 0
     'B' "" "" 0 0 0
     'E' "" 0
     'S'
     'Y'

     'P' "" "INSERT INTO test_tbl VALUES(1)" 0
     'B' "" "" 0 0 0
     'E' "" 0
     'S'
     'Y'

     'P' "" "COMMIT" 0
     'B' "" "" 0 0 0
     'E' "" 0
     'S'
     'Y'

     'P' "S_1" "SELECT * FROM test_tbl" 0
     'D' 'S' "S_1"
     'B' "C_1" "S_1" 0 0 0
     'E' "C_1" 0
     'S'
     'Y'

     'X'
    </programlisting>

    <para>
     To fix it, <function>parse_before_bind()</function> should be called only if we are in a transaction block so that we can send <command>Bind</command> and <command>Execute</command> to the right backend.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-06-07 [378111d]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> hang when used by <productname>erlang</productname> applications. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <productname>Erlang</productname> 客户端发送"Describe"消息后跟"Flush"。  So the
     backend returns "Row description." 然而 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> forgets to reset
     the query in progress flag upon receiving "Row description" message,
     then <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> keeps on waiting for response from backend. This is the
     cause of erlang client hanging.
    </para>
    <para>
     修复 is, just reset the query in progress flag upon receiving "Row
     description" message. "no data"消息也有同样的情况。
    </para>
    <para>
     See <ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2017-June/005613.html">[pgpool-general: 5555]</ulink> for more details.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-06-07 [cfcb85e]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 bug with 向错误目标节点发送bind消息。 (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=314">bug 314</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-05-31 [ba69889]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 node.js使用时查询缓存挂起。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     See <ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2017-May/005569.html">[pgpool-general: 5511]</ulink> for more details.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-05-28 [9de196b]
    -->
    <para>
     处理 with <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 10 in streaming replication delay checking. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-05-27 [52769db]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 query cache memory leak. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     Clearing cache buffers in case of no oid queries (like <command>BEGIN</command>,
     <command>CHECKPOINT</command>, <command>VACUUM</command>, etc) should have been done, but it did not.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-05-23 [27a516a]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 某些情况下的扩展查询挂起。 (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <productname>errlang</productname> PostgreSQL API produces <command>Parse ('P')</command>, <command>Describe ('D')</command>,
     <command>Flush ('H')</command>, <command>Bind ('B')</command>, and <command>Execute ('E')</command>. Notice the 'H' message (this
     does not happen in <productname>JDBC</productname>. I suspect that's the reason why this problem
     is not popular before). After that, <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> dropped the extended
     query mode, 它无法找到从哪个后端读取数据。 Thus <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> simply tries to read all of backend which causes hang
     因为它可能没有向某些后端发送消息。
    </para>
    <para>
     解决方案是，收到flush消息后设置进行扩展查询标志。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2017-05-10 [7b2ef18]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 corner case bug in <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> starting up. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     It is possible that a failover request is accepted before primary node
     is searched.  This leads <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> to a strange state: there's no
     primary node if the failed node was a primary node (even if new
     primary node exists as a result of promotion of existing standby).
    </para>

    <para>
     See <ulink url="http://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2017-May/002321.html">[pgpool-hackers: 2321]</ulink> for more details.
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>

